{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094","title":"腾讯混元 Hy4 权重开放：770B 稀疏 MoE，普通机器跑不动","date":"2026-11-20","updated":"2026-11-20","summary":"腾讯混元 Hy4 权重开放：770B 稀疏 MoE，普通机器跑不动","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/wordmark-wide-31574ab39ae5.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Hy4","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4","source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>腾讯混元官方模型仓库里多了一个新名字：tencent/Hy4。官方页面写明它支持文本、图像和视频理解，语言主干总参数 770B，每个 token 实际激活 49B；上下文长度 1M（1,048,576 tokens）。同时放出来的还有 Hy4-FP8 量化版和只做了预训练的 Hy4 base 权重，分发渠道是 Hugging Face、ModelScope 和 GitCode。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-1-cf4703fa.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/fded5fbc56b31ee1745e9bce-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/fded5fbc56b31ee1745e9bce-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-1-cf4703fa.png\" alt=\"官方模型介绍\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>开放权重不等于人人本地可跑</h2>\n<p>官方给出的部署方式是 vLLM 或 SGLang 服务：vLLM 示例镜像直接写死了 --tensor-parallel-size 8，SGLang 示例是 --tp 8，都是 8 卡并行在跑 774B 参数的 safetensors 权重（BF16 / F32 张量类型）。这意味着官方推荐的用法是把它放在一台多卡机器上做成 OpenAI 兼容接口服务，官方给的调用示例 base_url 是 <code>http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1</code>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-2-31ab035c.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/5ca48efef1b5de63ac7ad0b6-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/5ca48efef1b5de63ac7ad0b6-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-2-31ab035c.png\" alt=\"官方 vLLM 部署示例\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>那“每 token 只激活 49B”是什么意思？可以把它理解成快递仓储：仓库总货量是 770B 件，但每次给你送货的只从 256 个分区里挑 8 个分区加 1 个共享分区出货，实际搬货量约 49B。好处是搬运的人手少，坏处是货还在那儿——仓库本身要占地方。存放这些货物需要的显存或内存，不会因为每次只搬一部分而消失。所以想在自己电脑上跑的读者，先看仓库尺寸，而不是看每次出货量。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>建议</strong>\n官方在量化一节写明：为了端到端测试目的，提供了 GGUF 压缩版本，并推荐用 AngelSlim 工具链做压缩；仓库另列了 AngelSlim/Hy4-GGUF。权重开放、许可证、运行时和硬件条件是四件分开的事——Hy4 采用 Tencent Hy License，文件在仓库 LICENSE 里；本地能不能跑起来还取决于你手上的显存、量化格式和推理框架版本，这几项需要分别核实，不能从“开放权重”四个字直接推出来。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-3-729e9b00.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/4fb0e31410f351904595f38c-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/4fb0e31410f351904595f38c-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-3-729e9b00.png\" alt=\"官方量化说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>官方成绩里最值得看的两类</h2>\n<p>按官方列出的数字看，Hy4 base 的知识类少样本预训练评测里，SimpleQA 得分 57.2、Chinese-SimpleQA 83.9、SuperGPQA 62.7；数学类 U-MATH 71.6、OCW Courses 66.7。多模态部分只报了 Hy4 Base 与 Hy4 flash Base 两行，MMMU-Pro（10 选项）59.6、RealWorldQA 72.3、CountBenchQA 90.6。官方表格明确标注加粗只表示该行可得的最高数值，不代表统计显著性。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-4-52a74e27.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/89d82fcb11372b7b5e037f37-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/89d82fcb11372b7b5e037f37-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-4-52a74e27.png\" alt=\"官方金融任务评测\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>官方自己给出的定位是评测数据，不是独立验证：在 579 个真实金融任务上，参与评测的是 213 位金融从业者，其中 153 位来自头部金融机构，超过 70% 有五年以上从业经验；Hy4 平均得分 3.04（满分 4），同表列出的对照模型为 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 的 2.97、Kimi K3.1 Pro 的 2.68、GLM-5.3 的 2.68，官方表述是在开放权重模型中排名第一。同一节还写明 Hy4 的幻觉率从 Hy4 preview 的 15.76% 降到 5.45%，推测性错误从 23.1% 降到 5.6%。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-5-03e7052c.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/ae04d3995f3a835ead622a73-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/ae04d3995f3a835ead622a73-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-20-official-fe17ae5d9094/source-evidence-5-03e7052c.png\" alt=\"官方已知限制\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>警告</strong>\n官方在 Known Limitations 里写得很直白：尽管 Hy4 是当下最强的开放权重模型之一，但在研究级数学、长周期编码、模型自我改进和高级视觉问答等内部高难基准上，与顶级专有模型仍存在明显差距。模型卡还附了一条免责声明：base 模型在中期训练阶段接触了大量合成指令数据，偶尔不按预期的答案格式输出，可能影响少样本评测分数。这些都属于官方自述，不能当成第三方复现结论。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>怎么判断值不值得上</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如果你只有消费级显卡，先看 GGUF 与 AngelSlim 的量化路线能否压到你机器的显存范围，而不是先看总参数。</li>\n<li>如果你需要图、视频理解或 computer use 工作流，Hy4 的多模态训练是这次相对 preview 的主要增量，值得实测。</li>\n<li>如果你的场景是财务、办公文档协作，官方给的 579 任务评测和幻觉率数据是最贴近你需求的参考，但结论来自官方内部评测。</li>\n<li>如果你的目标是研究级数学或超长周期编码任务，官方自己承认与专有模型有差距，别把它当唯一方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>落地时的下一步很具体：权重地址是 <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4\">查看页面：huggingface.co · Hy4</a> ，同批次还有 <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4-FP8\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4-FP8\">查看页面：huggingface.co · Hy4-FP8</a> 和 <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4-base\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4-base\">查看页面：huggingface.co · Hy4-base</a> ；官方推理配方分别指向 vLLM recipe 与 SGLang cookbook，系统卡在 hy.tencent.ai。核实顺序建议是：先确认手上的推理框架版本是否已支持该模型，再看量化权重体积是否落在自己硬件能承受的范围，最后用官方推荐参数 temperature=0.9、top_p=1.0、reasoning_effort 默认 high 跑一个自己熟悉的真实任务，测三到五个自己的问题而不是看公开榜单。</p>\n<h2>官方资料</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4\">腾讯混元 官方发布说明</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-18-official-79bf4392ad36","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-18-official-79bf4392ad36","slug":"2026-11-18-official-79bf4392ad36","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯混元开源 Hy4 flash：每 token 只激活 11.3B 参数，本地部署现在要什么门槛","date":"2026-11-18","updated":"2026-11-18","summary":"腾讯混元开源 Hy4 flash：每 token 只激活 11.3B 参数，本地部署现在要什么门槛","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-18-official-79bf4392ad36/wordmark-wide-48f8a8e554ad.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-18-official-79bf4392ad36/wordmark-wide-48f8a8e554ad.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Hy4-flash","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy4-flash","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-18-official-79bf4392ad36.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","slug":"2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video-9B能同时看画面、听原声，接入前要准备什么？","date":"2026-11-22","updated":"2026-11-22","summary":"官方已列出权重与部署方法，但视频原声需要明确接入，运行环境也有补丁要求。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/wordmark-wide-05acad5ce433.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/wordmark-wide-05acad5ce433.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-9B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","slug":"2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video能连画面带声音理解视频，部署前该看哪些条件？","date":"2026-11-22","updated":"2026-11-22","summary":"腾讯WeMM-Video能连画面带声音理解视频，部署前该看哪些条件？","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5/wordmark-wide-bae77126e5e7.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5/wordmark-wide-bae77126e5e7.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-